DTSTAMP:20261029T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:Campbell's sixth emergency order expires
DESCRIPTION:DOE has renewed the J.H. Campbell order five times since May 20
 25\, and the one court ruling so far vacated an order that had already exp
 ired. A seventh renewal fits KPA call BF-3: Campbell still listed as opera
 ting in March 2027. https://kpa.energy/findings/#campbell-460
URL:https://kpa.energy/findings/#campbell-460
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kpa-20261209-1@kpa.energy
DTSTAMP:20261029T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:PJM 2029/30 capacity auction opens
DESCRIPTION:Bidding runs 9–15 December\, with results due around 22 Decem
 ber. It settles KPA call LB-1: a clear at the price cap. https://kpa.energ
 y/findings/#pjm-price
URL:https://kpa.energy/findings/#pjm-price
END:VEVENT
